## How to test

```bash
php spark modules:sync              # namespace, migrations, permissions, settings, assets
php spark permissions:check
vendor/bin/phpunit modules/Zoo
```

By hand: `php spark modules:demo Zoo`, then `<back office>/zoo` (`backend_path('zoo')`) with a user of the `admin` group.
